summary.label:
This app allows XEE-KIDS Watch owners to control, track and communicate remotely.

Once connected, parents are able to:

- Add, edit and delete Watch Contacts;
- Add, edit and delete Watch Alarms;
- View Watch location on map;
- View Daily, Weekly and Monthly Temperature, Heart Rate and Steps Reports
- Browse previous watch locations on map for a given day;
- View the GPS trajectory of the watch on a map;
- View the current battery level of the watch;
- Edit the profile of the Parent and the Child wearing the watch;
- Upload user images for easier watch switching;
- Manage multiple watches;
- Reject or Approve incoming watch pairing requests from other Parents;
- Block previously approved watch connections;
- Remotely, update the Watch's sound settings such as volume and vibration;

And so much more
